    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On Pakistan's 76th Independence Day, Dr Zulfiqar A. Bhutta, a distinguished member of AKU's community was bestowed with the Sitara-e-Imtiaz by President Arif Alvi. This is not the first time that Dr Bhutta is being conferred with a national award; in 2017 he was conferred with the President's Pride of Performance award for his exceptional contributions to the country.",
